      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow4:050",
        "answer": "Builds player/enemy score containers and special escort/prop/CTF children. Initializes gameTimeLow and team sizes, binds score/color/lives models and uses roundsPlayed/teamSize notifications to reread text/progress. Player-height override resizes the parent. Mode/state predicates are conditional presentation paths, not HMH source exclusions. Creates self via LUI.UIElement.new, Blur via LUI.UIImage.new, Panel via LUI.UIImage.new, EnemyTeamScoreContainer via CoD.ScoreInfo_ScoreContainer.new, PlayerTeamScoreContainer via CoD.ScoreInfo_ScoreContainer.new, LED via LUI.UIImage.new, LEDFull via LUI.UIImage.new, Frame via LUI.UIImage.new, EscortScoreInfo via CoD.ScoreInfoEscort.new, PropScoreInfo via CoD.ScoreInfoProp.new, ScoreInfoCTF via CoD.ScoreInfoCTF.new. Stores state predicates Escort, Prop, CTF, RoundBased; their body effects require state-system evaluation.",
